  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Alteration sphere, Life sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you shapeshift a creature, you may spend a spell point as a free action to allow them to regain one hit point for every Hit Die they possess. The target regains an additional hit point per Hit Die for each (cure) talent you possess. This healing is not positive energy.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alteration#toc106\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
